TeX input and expected MathML in mathjax-4.1.3.json are extracted from:
MathJax-src 4.1.3, commit fb987178c2d279a99b0db5ea02e751691703955e
https://github.com/mathjax/MathJax-src/tree/4.1.3/testsuite/tests/input/tex
Licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.MathJax.
MathJax project attribution: The MathJax Consortium.

This distribution converts upstream tests/snapshots into JSON and adds captured
configuration, ordering, source hashes and coverage metadata. It is not an
unmodified upstream distribution. No upstream NOTICE or NOTICE.txt was present
at the root of the source revision used. This file is harness attribution,
not an upstream NOTICE.

The retry registration in conformance/mathjax.mjs is adapted from
MathJax-src 4.1.3 testsuite/tests/input/tex/Begingroup.test.ts, lines 17-26,
under Apache-2.0. It reproduces the upstream test-local CommandMap and Configuration.
